## Opting out

Prose styles everything inside it. To embed a widget in an article (a form, a menu, a demo) without prose margins and list styles, put `data-ui="not-prose"` on its wrapper; prose picks up again after it.

```html
<article data-ui="prose">
  <p>Prose styles this paragraph.</p>
  <div data-ui="not-prose">
    <ul><li>But not this list.</li></ul>
  </div>
</article>
```

